{"anchorId":3058,"message":"Spring emergence appears healthy, with buds breaking evenly across the canopy and fresh leaf growth suggesting the Brunswick Plane is entering the season with good vitality. No obvious signs of delayed flushing or major dieback are apparent from this stage, though continued observation through full leaf-out would give a clearer picture.","witnessAddress":"0xe0144fa05a0d32b5b1de10ccee7211616b3e3ef0","timestamp":"2026-03-22T21:49:54.081Z","secretVerified":true}